6
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,360
Can I start to concentrate on emitter training now?

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,160
No way!

8
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:26,900
You might have gotten pretty close, but you're still off by a tenth of a second.

9
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,720
Your goal is to be within a hundredth of a second.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,120
Now, begin!

